flowchart TD
  Install[install_signed_rule] --> Sign[canonical + HMAC cookie]
  Sign --> Golden[(golden store)]
  Sign --> Switch[OVS table 0]
  Tamper[external ovs-ofctl change] --> Switch
  Switch --> Monitor[NXST monitor event]
  Monitor --> Verify[targeted stats + verify]
  Golden --> Verify
  Verify --> Risk[risk engine]
  L2[L2 canary probes] --> Risk
  L3[L3 ML score] --> Risk
  Risk --> Respond[restore / quarantine / alert]
  Respond --> Alert[alert -> spool -> core -> dashboard]
